# No AI attribution

Do not credit AI agents as an author, co-author, contributor, or commenter on this repository.

- Never add AI `Co-authored-by` trailers to commit messages.
- Never post GitHub comments, PR reviews, or issues as an AI agent.
- Never add AI agents to README acknowledgments, contributor lists, or "Created by" lines.
- If the host injects an AI co-author trailer, strip it before push. Use `.githooks/commit-msg` (copy to `.git/hooks/commit-msg`).
- Human contributors (for example 12Matt3r, vjcharles) stay credited as usual.
